#. module: import_res_id
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_import_res_id
msgid ""
"=============\n"
"Import Res ID\n"
"=============\n"
"\n"
".. \n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"   !! This file is generated by oca-gen-addon-readme !!\n"
"   !! changes will be overwritten.                   !!\n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"   !! source digest: sha256:a2e46af534d3d717f9ce869a517e30acc50c9c8de85879c534567ab8392d33a8\n"
"   !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\n"
"\n"
".. |badge1| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/maturity-Beta-yellow.png\n"
"    :target: https://odoo-community.org/page/development-status\n"
"    :alt: Beta\n"
".. |badge2| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/license-LGPL--3-blue.png\n"
"    :target: http://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0-standalone.html\n"
"    :alt: License: LGPL-3\n"
".. |badge3| image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/github-GetFluvo%2Faddons-lightgray.png?logo=github\n"
"    :target: https://github.com/GetFluvo/addons/tree/20.0/import_res_id\n"
"    :alt: GetFluvo/addons\n"
"\n"
"|badge1| |badge2| |badge3|\n"
"\n"
"Adds a *Document XML ID* field, ``res_external_id``, to messages\n"
"(``mail.message``) and attachments (``ir.attachment``), to link them to\n"
"their document by the XML ID of that document.\n"
"\n"
"Messages and attachments point to their document with a model name and a\n"
"database id, which an import file cannot know. With this field, chatter\n"
"messages and attachments can be imported for records imported earlier.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Use Cases / Context\n"
"===================\n"
"\n"
"When migrating to Odoo, the history of the records, the chatter messages\n"
"and the attachments, has to be imported too. Without this module the\n"
"import file needs the database id of every document, which is only known\n"
"after the documents are imported.\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"Import messages or attachments with a ``res_external_id`` column holding\n"
"the complete XML ID of the document, as ``module.name``. The model and\n"
"the id of the document are set from it:\n"
"\n"
"+--------------------------------+--------------+-----------------------+-------------------------+\n"
"| body                           | message_type | res_external_id       | attachment_ids/id       |\n"
"+================================+==============+=======================+=========================+\n"
"| ``<p>Called the customer</p>`` | comment      | ``legacy.partner_42`` | ``legacy.attachment_7`` |\n"
"+--------------------------------+--------------+-----------------------+-------------------------+\n"
"\n"
"The field can also be given to ``create()`` and ``write()``, and is\n"
"filled in exports with the first XML ID of the document.\n"
"\n"
"- An XML ID that does not exist stops the import with an error, instead\n"
"  of creating a message or attachment that is not linked to anything.\n"
"- The usual access rights apply to the document. Only administrators can\n"
"  move an existing message to another document.\n"
"- Import the attachments first, linked to the document with\n"
"  ``res_external_id``, then the messages that refer to them with\n"
"  ``attachment_ids/id``.\n"
"\n"
"When importing a history, import the documents themselves with\n"
"``\"mail_create_nolog\": True`` or ``\"tracking_disable\": True`` in the\n"
"context, so that Odoo does not add a *created* message of today next to\n"
"the imported messages. Messages keep the ``date`` and ``author_id`` of\n"
"the import file. To also keep their ``create_uid`` and ``create_date``,\n"
"use the ``import_metadata`` module.\n"
"\n"
"Bug Tracker\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"Bugs are tracked on `GitHub Issues <https://github.com/GetFluvo/addons/issues>`_.\n"
"In case of trouble, please check there if your issue has already been reported.\n"
"If you spotted it first, help us to smash it by providing a detailed and welcomed\n"
"`feedback <https://github.com/GetFluvo/addons/issues/new?body=module:%20import_res_id%0Aversion:%2020.0%0A%0A**Steps%20to%20reproduce**%0A-%20...%0A%0A**Current%20behavior**%0A%0A**Expected%20behavior**>`_.\n"
"\n"
"Do not contact contributors directly about support or help with technical issues.\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"Authors\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"* Fluvo\n"
"\n"
"Contributors\n"
"------------\n"
"\n"
"- bosd\n"
"\n"
"Other credits\n"
"-------------\n"
"\n"
"Based on the idea and the ``res_external_id`` field of the\n"
"``import_res_id`` module of\n"
"`easier_import <https://github.com/tfrancoi/easier_import>`__ by\n"
"Thibault Francois. This is a new implementation.\n"
"\n"
"Maintainers\n"
"-----------\n"
"\n"
"This module is part of the `GetFluvo/addons <https://github.com/GetFluvo/addons/tree/20.0/import_res_id>`_ project on GitHub.\n"
"\n"
"You are welcome to contribute.\n"
msgstr ""

